{"t":{"ventilācijas komplekti ar termostatu SPKT":"<p>SPKT ventilācijas kompkets tiek lietots siltā gaisa pārvieto&scaron;anai. Termostats ieslēdz ventilatoru, kas aizvada silto gaisu uz blakus telpu vai arī izvada to ārā. Ventilators izslēgsies, kad telpā ar siltuma avotu samazināsies temperatūra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://europlast.lv/storage/images/1670397000.jpg\" align=\"right\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" alt=\"\" />Konstrukcija</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Ventilators: aksiālais<br />\r\nGultņa veids: lodī&scaron;u gultņi<br />\r\nTermostats<br />\r\nPretvārsts<br />\r\nApļais gaisa vads no plastmasas<br />\r\nVentilācijas reste: plastmasas</p>\r\n<p><br />\r\n<strong>Montāža</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Montāžas pozīcija: vertikāli, horizintāli<br />\r\nPielietojums: iek&scaron;telpu</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Spriegums</strong>: 230V-50Hz vienfāzes</p>\r\n<p>Darba temperatūra: + 5&deg;C to + 40&deg;C</p>\r\n<p>Izmēri: 100, 125</p>\r\n<p>Krāsas: Balta</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"table styled-table table--docs-9\" border=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(39, 40, 42); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\" width=\"100%\" height=\"81\">\r\n    <tbody style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n        <tr style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 21px; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);\">\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-left-color: inherit; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; border-right-color: inherit; border-top: 0px !important; width: 154.562px; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Artikuls</span></td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-left-color: inherit; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; border-right-color: inherit; border-top: 0px !important; width: 154.562px; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Spriegums</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">(V/Hz)</span></td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-left-color: inherit; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; border-right-color: inherit; border-top: 0px !important; width: 136.578px; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Jauda (W)</span></td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-left-color: inherit; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; border-right-color: inherit; border-top: 0px !important; width: 128.891px; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">IP</span></td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8p