older; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Trok&scaron;ņa līmenis:</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3m attālumā,</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Lp A dB(A)</span></td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-left-color: inherit; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; border-right-color: inherit; border-top: 0px !important; width: 136.562px; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Vides darba</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">temperatūra</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">min/max (&deg;C)</span></td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-left-color: inherit; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; border-right-color: inherit; border-top: 0px !important; width: 116.625px; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Svars</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bolder; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">(kg)</span></td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 21px;\">\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 154.562px; height: 21px;\">SPKT100</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 154.562px; height: 21px;\">220-240V/50Hz</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 136.578px; height: 21px;\">7</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 128.891px; height: 21px;\">IPX4</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 149.422px; height: 21px;\">2000</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 127.938px; height: 21px;\">65</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 150.922px; height: 21px;\">26</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 136.562px; height: 21px;\">+5/+40</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 116.625px; height: 21px;\">0,74</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 21px;\">\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 154.562px; height: 21px;\">SPKT125</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 154.562px; height: 21px;\">220-240V/50Hz</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 136.578px; height: 21px;\">10</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 128.891px; height: 21px;\">IPX4</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 149.422px; height: 21px;\">1500</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 127.938px; height: 21px;\">105</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 150.922px; height: 21px;\">30</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 136.562px; height: 21px;\">+5/+40</td>\r\n            <td style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 9px 8px 8px; text-align: center; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: inherit; border-left-width: 0px !important; border-left-style: initial !important; border-right-width: 0px !important; border-right-style: initial !important; width: 116.625px; height: 21px;\">0,90</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>","sienas plastmasas komplekti SPK":"<p>&nbsp;Plastmasas sienas ventilācijas komplekts, kas paredzēts gaisa izvadī&scaron;anai no telpas ar regulējamo iek&scaron;telpu resti.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Konstrukcija:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Izgatavots no plastmasas. <br />\r\nPutekļu filtrs.<br />\r\nFiltra klase: EU1</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p><strong>Montāža</strong>:&nbsp;Montējams sienā, fiksējams ar līmi vai skrūvēm.</p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","komplekti, pieplūdes vārsti ar skaņas izolāciju SPK2":"<p>&nbsp;SPK2 ir komplekts, kas nodro&scaron;ina dabisku gaisa plūsmu vai izplūdi no telpas. &Scaron;ī sistēma ir paredzēta uzstādī&scaron;anai visu veidu telpās. Sistēmu ieteicams uzstādīt siltuma avota tuvumā, augstu uz griestiem. Ja telpā ir radiators, ventilācijas caurule jānovieto virs tā. Tas nodro&scaron;ina silta gaisa sajauk&scaron;anos ar telpā ienāko&scaron;o gaisu, tādējādi nodro&scaron;inot maksimālu komfortu. SPK2 ir aprīkots ar vārstu, kuru var regulēt ar auklu vai sviru. SPK2 ir aprīkots ar skaņu absorbējo&scaron;iem materiāliem, kas samazina troksni telpās. SPK2 ir aprīkots ar EU1 filtru, kas nodro&scaron;ina aizsardzību pret putekļiem un kukaiņiem. Visus elementus ir viegli noņemt un tīrīt!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Konstrukcija</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Plastmasas difuzors<br />\r\nTermiski izolēts disks<br />\r\nMazgājams filtrs<br />\r\nApaļais kanāls plastmasas<br />\r\nSkaņas izolācija<br />\r\nRegulējams gaisa plūsmas vārsts<br />\r\nĀrēja ventilācijas reste, veidota no alumīnija<br />\r\nAprīkots ar pret kukaiņu sietu</p>\r\n<p><strong>Montāža</strong>:&nbsp;Montējams sienā, fiksējams ar līmi vai skrūvēm.</p>","sienas plastmasas komplekti SPK3-6":"<p>&nbsp;&Scaron;is sienas ventilācijas komplekts izgatavoti no augstvērtīga plastmasas sakausējuma un paredzēts gaisa izvadī&scaron;anai no telpas. Ventilācijas sienas komplekts pieejams dažādos diametros.<br />\r\nSPK3-6 - aprīkots ar pretvārstu un ir teleskopiski regulējams,</p>","komplekti, pieplūdes vārsti ar skaņas izolāciju, metāla SMK2-3":"<p>&nbsp;SMK2-3 ventilācijas komplekts nodro&scaron;ina dabisku gaisa apmaiņu telpā. Sistēma paredzētas uzstādī&scaron;anai visos telpas tipos. Komplektu vēlams uzstādīt siltuma avota tuvumā, kas nodro&scaron;ina siltā gaisa samaisī&scaron;anos ar telpā ienāko&scaron;o gaisu, tā nodro&scaron;inot maksimālu komfortu.&nbsp;SMK3 izgatavots no augstas kvalitātes metāla, kas garantē to ilgmūžību. Ventilācijas sistēma aprīkota ar skaņas izolāciju, kas samazina skaņas nokļū&scaron;anu iek&scaron;telpās. SMK2-3 aprīkots ar EU1 filtru, kas nodro&scaron;ina aizsardzību pret putekļiem un kukaiņiem. Elementus ir viegli izņemt un iztīrīt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Konstrukcija</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>Difuzors izgatavots no tērauda ar polimēru pārklājumu, krāsa balta (RAL9016)</li>\r\n    <li>Maināma gaisa plūsma</li>\r\n    <li>Mazgājams filtrs</li>\r\n    <li>Teleskopisks gaisa vads, izgatavot no cinkotā tērauda</li>\r\n    <li>Aprīkots ar EPDM gumijas blīvi</li>\r\n    <li>Skaņas izolācijas slānis no putu poliuretāna</li>\r\n    <li>Ārējā ventilācijas reste izgatavota no alumīnija sakausējuma</li>\r\n    <li>Aprīkots ar metāla insektu sietu 2x2mm</li>\r\n</ul>"}}